<title>FRANCE: French Nov official reserves 304.124 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>French Nov official reserves 304.124 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France and finance ministry gave the following breakdown of offical gold and foreign exchange reserves (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					  Nov    Oct</p>
<p> Total reserves		   304.124  303.839</p>
<p> Gold				 164.814  164.814</p>
<p> Ecu				   51.352   51.352</p>
<p> Foreign exchange		  68.933   68.700</p>
<p> Credits with IMF		  19.025   18.973</p>
</text>
